# What 'dev-tools/ci/coverage_report.py' writes: the merged report the
# "Coverage" job uploads, its scratch space, the artifacts it downloads into,
# and the pull request comment it renders. Reproducing that merge locally is
# what 'docs/source/contributing.rst' documents, and it leaves all four here.
coverage-comment.md
coverage-data/
coverage-report/
coverage-work/
